[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 10142.63, "timestamp": "02:49:02", "text": "那它叫什么来着？嗯，就是那些CD。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10147.469, "timestamp": "02:49:07", "text": "变化。就像我们做的那些 Twitch CD 一样。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10152.15, "timestamp": "02:49:12", "text": "在 Twitch 上，就像……就像……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10155.349, "timestamp": "02:49:15", "text": "就像你们这些马拉万混蛋，醒醒吧。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10157.51, "timestamp": "02:49:17", "text": "是的。你，我身处战争之中。你感觉如何？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10159.51, "timestamp": "02:49:19", "text": "更热？天气真热。它"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10162.309, "timestamp": "02:49:22", "text": "这里下雨了。什么努力？那是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10163.71, "timestamp": "02:49:23", "text": "下雨了"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10166.95, "timestamp": "02:49:26", "text": "早上起来，而我一直在睡觉。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10170.79, "timestamp": "02:49:30", "text": "劳拉说我们吃过东西，但我们没死。劳拉"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10175.11, "timestamp": "02:49:35", "text": "午餐时，我凌晨3点就醒了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10179.11, "timestamp": "02:49:39", "text": "再次。 3. 我被迫凌晨3点起床"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10182.63, "timestamp": "02:49:42", "text": "呃，我答应劳拉一个令人难以置信的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10185.99, "timestamp": "02:49:45", "text": "只有我这样的天才才能使用的武器"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10189.75, "timestamp": "02:49:49", "text": "创造。一颗攻击脑子的炸弹。木栓"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10192.15, "timestamp": "02:49:52", "text": "黑客攻击。这就是马拉万追杀我的原因。"}]